  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kurwara kwaHezekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumazuva iwayo Hezekia akarwara kusvikira oda kufa. Muprofita Isaya mwanakomana waAmozi akaenda kwaari akati, \"Zvanzi naJehovha: Gadzirisa zveimba yako, nokuti uri kuzofa; hausi kuzopona.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akatendeukira kumadziro akanyengetera kuna Jehovha achiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Rangarirai henyu, Jehovha, kuti ndakafamba sei nokutendeka pamberi penyu nomwoyo wose nechokwadi uye ndikaita zvakanaka pamberi penyu.\" Hezekia akachema kwazvo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo shoko raJehovha rakauya kuna Isaya richiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Enda undoti kuna Hezekia, 'Zvanzi naJehovha, Mwari wababa vako Dhavhidhi: Ndanzwa munyengetero wako uye ndaona misodzi yako; ndichawedzera makore gumi namashanu paupenyu hwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uye ndichakurwira iwe neguta rino kubva muruoko rwamambo weAsiria. Ndicharwira guta rino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ichi ndicho chiratidzo chaJehovha kwauri kuti Jehovha achaita zvose zvaakavimbisa:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndichaita kuti mumvuri waitwa pazuva udzokere shure nhambwe gumi pamutaro wawanga wafamba pamanera aAhazi.' \" Saizvozvo zuva rakadzokera shure nhambwe gumi dzarakanga radzika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinyorwa chaHezekia mambo weJudha mushure mokurwara nokupora kwake:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakati, \"Mazuva oupenyu hwangu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "achangotanga ndingafanira kupinda mumasuo orufu here?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndigotorerwa makore angu asara here?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakati, \"Handichazoonizve Jehovha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "iye Jehovha, munyika yavapenyu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "handichazotarisizve kuvanhu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kana kuva naavo vagere munyika ino zvino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Setende romufudzi, imba yangu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "yakoromorwa uye yatorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Somuruki ndapeta upenyu hwangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "uye iye andigura kubva pachirukiso;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "masikati namadekwana makaita kuti ndigume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakamirira nomwoyo murefu kusvikira mambakwedza,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "asi iye akavhuna mapfupa angu ose kufanana nezvinoitwa neshumba;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "masikati namadekwana makaita kuti ndigume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakarira senyenganyenga kana kondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndakachema sokuchema kunoita njiva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meso angu akaneta nokutarisa kudenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haiwa Jehovha, ndine nhamo, uyai mundinunure!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ndingati kudiniko?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iye ataura neni, uye iye ndiye aita izvi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndichafamba nokuzvininipisa pamakore angu ose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nokuda kwokurwadziwa kwomwoyo wangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishe, vanhu vanorarama nezvinhu zvakadai;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "uye mweya wangu unowana upenyu mazviriwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Makandiporesa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mukandiraramisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zvirokwazvo kutambudzika kwangu kukuru",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kwakandivigira rugare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Murudo rwenyu makandirwira",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
